  <data name="BitsExplanation" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Every square is one bit (black: 1), 64 per row, the first 4096 bits. Random bits look like noise; stripes, columns or blocks mean that the sequence is regular.</value>
  </data>
  <data name="BitsTitle" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>The bits</value>
  </data>
  <data name="ErrorTitle" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>The data cannot be shown</value>
  </data>
  <data name="HistogramExplanation" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>How often each group of four byte values occurs; the red line is the expected number. For random bytes the columns are about equally high, with some variation.</value>
  </data>
  <data name="HistogramTitle" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>The byte values</value>
  </data>
  <data name="InputDataCaption" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Random bytes</value>
  </data>
  <data name="InputDataTooltip" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>The sequence of bytes to look at, for example the output of a random number generator as a byte array.</value>
  </data>
  <data name="PairsExplanation" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Every point is a pair of consecutive bytes (x: a byte, y: the next one), up to 4000 pairs. Random bytes fill the square evenly; lines and lattices show that the next byte can be predicted from the one before.</value>
  </data>
  <data name="PairsTitle" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Each byte against the next one</value>
  </data>
  <data name="PluginCaption" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Random Visualization</value>
  </data>
  <data name="PluginTooltip" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Shows a sequence of random bytes as bits, histogram and plot of consecutive bytes</value>
  </data>
  <data name="SummaryCaption" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Summary</value>
  </data>
  <data name="SummaryLine" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>{0} bytes. Mean {1:F2} (random bytes: about 127.5). Chi-square {2:F1} (random bytes: about 255, with a spread of about 23). Correlation with the next byte {3:F3} (random bytes: about 0).</value>
  </data>
  <data name="SummaryTooltip" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Number of bytes, mean, chi-square value and serial correlation as text.</value>
  </data>
  <data name="Title" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>How random is this sequence?</value>
  </data>
  <data name="TooShort" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>At least two bytes are needed.</value>
  </data>
